USE LICENSE — NAUREN RPG SYSTEM FOR FOUNDRY VTT

Copyright (c) 2026 Gustavo Yamavaki. All rights reserved.

1. SCOPE

This license applies only to the "Nauren RPG" system for Foundry Virtual
Tabletop, that is, the contents of this repository and the package distributed
from it (code, interface templates, styles, compendiums, data, images and
documentation), hereinafter "the System".

This license does not cover the Nauren RPG rulebook or the "Nauren" brand,
and grants no rights over them.

2. WHAT IS PERMITTED

You may, free of charge:
  a) download and install the System in Foundry Virtual Tabletop, including on
     hosted servers (such as The Forge);
  b) use the System to play, at personal or community tables, provided you do
     not charge for access to the System itself;
  c) create, within your own Foundry world, characters, creatures, items and
     other game content using the System.

3. WHAT IS NOT PERMITTED WITHOUT THE AUTHOR'S WRITTEN AUTHORIZATION

  a) copying, redistributing, republishing or making the System available, in
     whole or in part, by any means (other repositories, websites, packages,
     download servers, mods or modules), except for the installation described
     in section 2;
  b) selling, renting, sublicensing or using the System, in whole or in part,
     in any paid product or service;
  c) modifying the System and distributing or publishing the modified version,
     or creating and publishing derivative works of it;
  d) extracting and reusing the System's code, compendiums, texts, images or
     data in another system, module or product;
  e) removing or altering authorship and copyright notices.

The technical ability to download, view or fork the repository on GitHub does
not authorize any of the uses above.

4. THIRD-PARTY CONTENT

The System may reference third-party content that is not distributed here
(for example, Foundry VTT's own icons, JB2A animations and modules such as
Sequencer and Automated Animations). Such content is subject to the licenses
of its respective authors.

5. NO WARRANTY

The System is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind, express or
implied. The author is not liable for data loss, damages or problems arising
from the use of the System.

6. TERMINATION

Any breach of this license automatically terminates the permission granted
in section 2.

7. GOVERNING LAW

This license is governed by the laws of the Federative Republic of Brazil, in
particular Law No. 9,610/1998 (Copyright) and Law No. 9,609/1998 (Computer
Programs).

8. CONTACT

Authorization requests: https://github.com/Yamavaki/Nauren-RPG/issues
